  "owner_feedback_verbatim": "Wow.  so, when you first start scrolling, there's a slight delay as before, and then a quick hop, then it's very smooth and almost no delay - smoothness is MUCH imrpoved, and delay is pretty good here.  Not perfect.  But, the startup takes a little bit.  So, slightly delay, skip a few lines, then go smooth.  For fast scroll, it just jumps and done.  Also, when you take you rhand off, it just stops.  It shoudl smooth stop depending on the speed of your scrolling.",
